The first Tailnet copy invocation stopped in discoverPreviewServerPid before the file-copy loop:

AssertionError [ERR_ASSERTION]: preview server has unexpected network handles

2 !== 1

The extra handle belonged to the active Agent Browser session used to inspect the pre-sync roadmap. No Tailnet targets were changed by this invocation. After closing that browser session, lsof showed only the existing listener on 127.0.0.1:8768; the subsequent copy and verification passed.
